        <mxCell id="ap_QTrn4xQyMTkjWQ10F-19" value="&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-message-model-slug=&quot;o1&quot; class=&quot;min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words text-start [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-5&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; data-message-id=&quot;4eff2dc8-93a7-48ab-86a4-36cceb683c44&quot; data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark&quot;&gt;&lt;pre data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-end=&quot;418&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;!overflow-visible&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;contain-inline-size rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-token-border-medium relative bg-token-sidebar-surface-primary dark:bg-gray-950&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;overflow-y-auto p-4&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;!whitespace-pre language-markdown&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 21px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Все приложения (Shop, CRM, MES) и соответствующие консьюмеры RabbitMQ используют единый механизм распределённого трейсинга.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;overflow-y-auto p-4&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;!whitespace-pre language-markdown&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 21px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;При отправке HTTP-запросов и публикации сообщений в очереди они передают &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-code&quot;&gt;`traceId`&lt;/span&gt; и &lt;span class=&quot;hljs-code&quot;&gt;`spanId`&lt;/span&gt; в заголовках.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;overflow-y-auto p-4&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;!whitespace-pre language-markdown&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 21px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;На стороне получателя эти заголовки извлекаются, чтобы продолжить трейс, формируя полную «цепочку» прохождения заказа через все сервисы системы.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;mb-2 flex gap-3 -ml-2&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center justify-start rounded-xl p-1&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex items-center&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-state=&quot;closed&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;button data-testid=&quot;copy-turn-action-button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Копировать&quot; class=&quot;rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center&quot;&gt;&lt;svg class=&quot;icon-md-heavy&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; fill=&quot;none&quot; viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; height=&quot;24&quot; width=&quot;24&quot;&gt;&lt;path fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; d=&quot;M7 5C7 3.34315 8.34315 2 10 2H19C20.6569 2 22 3.34315 22 5V14C22 15.6569 20.6569 17 19 17H17V19C17 20.6569 15.6569 22 14 22H5C3.34315 22 2 20.6569 2 19V10C2 8.34315 3.34315 7 5 7H7V5ZM9 7H14C15.6569 7 17 8.34315 17 10V15H19C19.5523 15 20 14.5523 20 14V5C20 4.44772 19.5523 4 19 4H10C9.44772 4 9 4.44772 9 5V7ZM5 9C4.44772 9 4 9.44772 4 10V19C4 19.5523 4.44772 20 5 20H14C14.5523 20 15 19.5523 15 19V10C15 9.44772 14.5523 9 14 9H5Z&quot; clip-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot; fill-rule=&quot;evenodd&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;flex&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-state=&quot;closed&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;button data-testid=&quot;good-response-turn-action-button&quot; aria-label=&quot;Хороший ответ&quot; class=&quot;rounded-lg text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-main-surface-secondary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;flex h-[30px] w-[30px] items-center justify-center&